  "description": "Skuhoom is a large brown play frame that combines a rock climbing wall, monkey bars, a rope net, a slide and a swing beam. Its product area is 35'2\" x 30'11\" and its safe play area 41'2\" x 36'11\". That calls for a big site such as a township park, a resort lawn or a large school ground. It is listed for 40 to 45 children. Most of the play here asks children to grip and pull, whether on the bars, the wall or the net. The skills it lists are hand and eye coordination and confidence. Its single brown colour gives it a natural look in a garden setting. Warranty on its galvanised pipe, moulded parts, laminates and rope is 3 years. Ask us for a site plan with Skuhoom drawn to scale.",
